From 027a1e10e503449269e18c10e8b76e9ef3b50571 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: "qwen.ai[bot]" <qwenlm-intl@service.alibaba.com>
Date: Sat, 17 Oct 2026 12:10:41 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 1/2] CaseSystem plugin: 3D case opening with animations, GUI,
 and permissions

- Added CaseSystem main class handling /cs commands, admin subcommands (reload/give/list/debug), tab completion, resource pack delivery, and lifecycle management for sub-managers.
- Implemented CaseManager for configuration parsing (cases, rarities, items), two-level GUIs (list/detail) with dynamic content display, and a flat GUI roulette fallback animation.
- Created DataManager supporting LuckPerms API integration for dynamic permission counters or JSON/SQLite storage fallback with async I/O thread and in-memory caching.
- Developed RewardManager for weighted random selection logic, placeholder resolution (built-in + PlaceholderAPI), and console command execution for rewards.
- Added AnimationManager stub/interface for version-specific 3D item displays using ProtocolLib on 1.19.2 and native ItemDisplay on 1.19.4+.
- Configured build.gradle with Paper API dependencies, optional compileOnly integrations (ProtocolLib, PlaceholderAPI, LuckPerms), and Gradle wrapper files.
- Established GitHub Actions workflow (.github/workflows/build.yml) to build the JAR via Gradle and upload artifacts/releases on tag pushes.
- Provided comprehensive config.yml example defining cases, rarities, weights, icons, CustomModelData, and command templates; added messages.yml for localization.
